[{:db/id 17592186064357 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-7e5a7057-c75f-58a1-a44c-a0f432c19ff8" "question-f35d86b3-7519-5854-aa4c-2e2db7273329" "question-4353f584-4713-51e4-b5d4-06957426d632" "question-2ebed451-a922-5502-8c5d-38c526edbe93" "question-3284d619-b4c5-546e-9770-6d85e8b67a95"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186063941 :question/problem "Find the value of $-15 \\div 3.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we are dividing a negative number $\\color{red}(-15)$ by a positive one $\\color{blue}(3).$ So the result will be negative:\n![](images/d1/d1a8196b5a3bee794d65631eeef52c4c1e0196072ae4a73aa644cad0ef191925.svg)\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $15$ by $3$ without any signs: $15 \\div 3 = 5.$ Therefore, we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{red}(-15)} \\div {\\color{blue}3} = {\\color{red}-5}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064358 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f38fc5f9-f4a7-5578-8b5a-a098d8f9b251" "question-4cd37308-69cf-558f-825f-b340b3494f5b" "question-293490a5-f5da-5ae6-a9f1-eec5818b96ec" "question-822d09bd-8894-5f3d-82a5-a6dc155ec2df" "question-21a4c7d5-f1fc-5147-9bdd-0ac9e7822f4a"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186063942 :question/problem "Calculate the value of $50 \\div (-5).$" :question/worked-solution "We have to divide a positive number $\\color{blue}(50)$ by a negative one $\\color{red}(-5).$ So the result will be negative:\n![](images/98/983fa6f525dec74ed6866abdba19f23e28e318208497cd351a473035907795e3.svg)\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $50$ by $5$ without any signs: $50 \\div 5 = 10.$ Therefore,  we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{blue}{50}} \\div {\\color{red}{(-5)}} = {\\color{red}{-10}}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064359 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-5c6475e1-3a2c-55b1-9db1-bc0a43ba26e7" "question-ec95d74e-de7e-5833-92e4-eefb1b764b4c" "question-7d266647-4143-55fa-b8ba-67aa2d0af36a" "question-5c7d30b8-6905-5aa1-9698-6647c2cba856" "question-ece8ebc2-b515-5b96-8b0d-093e31473688"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186063943 :question/problem "Calculate $-81\\div (-9).$" :question/worked-solution "We have to divide a negative number ${\\color{red}(-81)}$ by another negative number ${\\color{red}(-9)}.$ So the result will be positive:\n![](images/bc/bcbaff723e9bce7d0cd513fb879cbc0a9758c2c5d9d584f4c55aab9df25e46d3.svg)\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $81$ by $9$ without any signs: $81 \\div 9 = 9.$ Therefore,  we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{red}(-81)} \\div {\\color{red}(-9)} = {\\color{blue}9}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-7e5a7057-c75f-58a1-a44c-a0f432c19ff8" :question/id #uuid "7e5a7057-c75f-58a1-a44c-a0f432c19ff8" :question/math-academy-id "q-181146" :question/problem "The value of $(-11)÷3,$ expressed as an **improper fraction** in lowest terms, is{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Here, we are dividing a negative number $(-11)$ by a positive one $(3).$ So the result will be negative:\n\n$$\n(-11)÷3=-\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $11$ by $3$ without any signs: $11÷3=\\frac{11}{3}.$ Therefore, we get\n\n$$\n(-11)÷3=-\\frac{11}{3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2e548f1a-15cd-56b5-8697-74cf8c71e45a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2e548f1a-15cd-56b5-8697-74cf8c71e45a" :answer-field/id #uuid "2e548f1a-15cd-56b5-8697-74cf8c71e45a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-8c3c151b-7470-50b7-a8fb-b4942f64ed14" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8c3c151b-7470-50b7-a8fb-b4942f64ed14"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8c3c151b-7470-50b7-a8fb-b4942f64ed14" :answer/id #uuid "8c3c151b-7470-50b7-a8fb-b4942f64ed14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{11}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/v