to divide a positive number $(17)$ by a negative one $(-5).$ So the result will be negative:\n\n$$\n17÷(-5)=-\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $17$ by $-5$ without any signs: $17÷5=3\\,\\frac{2}{5}.$ Therefore,  we get\n\n$$\n17÷(-5)=-3\\,\\frac{2}{5}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3e551f8a-a1ad-5970-9d29-199b4b6d57c8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3e551f8a-a1ad-5970-9d29-199b4b6d57c8" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e551f8a-a1ad-5970-9d29-199b4b6d57c8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e1377e74-6b9b-50ed-ac51-4732ad022890" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8bb3cda5-ce30-5b82-896a-538fe9e6c036" "answer-e1377e74-6b9b-50ed-ac51-4732ad022890" "answer-f788771f-dfaf-5c32-9baf-4d3ac1de8f19" "answer-fcb3c801-abc5-50ff-8a6b-174e71081c3d" "answer-2aa6b9d0-5691-586c-8e8a-324f6edd422c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8bb3cda5-ce30-5b82-896a-538fe9e6c036" :answer/id #uuid "8bb3cda5-ce30-5b82-896a-538fe9e6c036" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\,\\frac{4}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e1377e74-6b9b-50ed-ac51-4732ad022890" :answer/id #uuid "e1377e74-6b9b-50ed-ac51-4732ad022890" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\,\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f788771f-dfaf-5c32-9baf-4d3ac1de8f19" :answer/id #uuid "f788771f-dfaf-5c32-9baf-4d3ac1de8f19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4\\,\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fcb3c801-abc5-50ff-8a6b-174e71081c3d" :answer/id #uuid "fcb3c801-abc5-50ff-8a6b-174e71081c3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,\\frac{4}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2aa6b9d0-5691-586c-8e8a-324f6edd422c" :answer/id #uuid "2aa6b9d0-5691-586c-8e8a-324f6edd422c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\,\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-5c6475e1-3a2c-55b1-9db1-bc0a43ba26e7" :question/id #uuid "5c6475e1-3a2c-55b1-9db1-bc0a43ba26e7" :question/math-academy-id "q-6152" :question/problem "$(-80)÷(-40)=$" :question/worked-solution "We have to divide a negative number $(-80)$ by another negative number $(-40).$ So the result will be positive:\n\n$$\n(-80)÷(-40)=\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $80$ by $40$ without any signs: $80÷40=2.$ Therefore,  we get\n\n$$\n(-80)÷(-40)=2.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1188c56b-7fd1-56e2-ad5d-b664e01ba6e2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1188c56b-7fd1-56e2-ad5d-b664e01ba6e2" :answer-field/id #uuid "1188c56b-7fd1-56e2-ad5d-b664e01ba6e2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3e02f451-27ef-5362-8091-7dd25ef87e22" :answer-field/choices ["answer-24ab75b5-bafa-59af-804a-e71c2df734a0" "answer-c79f92f7-322c-5a7d-bae2-e3ffe8307830" "answer-3e02f451-27ef-5362-8091-7dd25ef87e22" "answer-1a6dfcea-4345-5f81-9b9e-c8a687f4b23a" "answer-1bb120a6-6d91-5d55-8a54-ee19926573b5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-24ab75b5-bafa-59af-804a-e71c2df734a0" :answer/id #uuid "24ab75b5-bafa-59af-804a-e71c2df734a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c79f92f7-322c-5a7d-bae2-e3ffe8307830" :answer/id #uuid "c79f92f7-322c-5a7d-bae2-e3ffe8307830" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3e02f451-27ef-5362-8091-7dd25ef87e22" :answer/id #uuid "3e02f451-27ef-5362-8091-7dd25ef87e22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1a6dfcea-4345-5f81-9b9e-c8a687f4b23a" :answer/id #uuid "1a6dfcea-4345-5f81-9b9e-c8a687f4b23a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1bb120a6-6d91-5d55-8a54-ee19926573b5" :answer/id #uuid "1bb120a6-6d91-5d55-8a54-ee19926573b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ec95d74e-de7e-5833-92e4-eefb1b764b4c" :question/id #uuid "ec95d74e-de7e-5833-92e4-eefb1b764b4c" :question/math-academy-id "q-42846" :question/problem "Expressed as a mixed number, $(-12)÷(-5)=$" :question/worked-solution "We have to divide a negative number $(-12)$ by another negative number $(-5).$ So the result will be positive:\n\n$$\n(-12)÷(-5)=\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $12$ by $5$ without any signs: $12÷5=2\\,\\frac{2}{5}.$ Therefore,  we get\n\n$$\n(-12)÷(-5)=2\\,\\frac{2}{5}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e54ef2c3-97e0-59be-8cf4-1f699bf7103b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e54ef2c3-97e0-59be-8cf4-1f699bf7103b" :answer-field/id #uuid "e54ef2c3-97e0-59be-8cf4-1f699bf7103b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-bb6cbb1d-2ff8-5acc-9a27-96e21d7896ff" :answer-field/choices ["answer-701601b2-cff8-5aa9-9823-103d44420451" "answer-b1747ff0-d21e-50a4-9bad-fde0fc594e0a" "answer-80b50e71-92ae-5cd2-9036-63c861213bed" "answer-bb6cbb1d-2ff8-5acc-9a27-96e21d7896ff" "answer-8e3eb282-c966-5745-9e01-3c0009cde374"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-701601b2-cff8-5aa9-9823-103d44420451" :answer/id #uuid "701601b2-cff8-5aa9-9823-103d44420451" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\,\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b1747ff0-d21e-50a4-9bad-fde0fc594e0a" :answer/id #uuid "b1747ff0-d21e-50a4-9bad-fde0fc594e0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\,\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-80b50e71-92ae-5cd2-9036-63c861213bed" :answer/id #uuid "80b50e71-92ae-5cd2-9036-63c86